OL,3,GNEWSAJail for speeding driver found
OL,4,Ahiding in bin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who admitted dangerous
OL,7,Fdriving, speeding, failing to stop for
OL,8,Fpolice and driving without insurance
OL,9,Fwas found hiding in a bin by police.
OL,11,FCaolan Harkin, 23, of Rosses Gate in
OL,12,FLondonderry, was initially spotted by
OL,13,Fpolice driving at 84mph (135km/h) on
OL,14,FDerry's Glenshane Road on 16 February.
OL,16,FLondonderry Magistrates' Court was told
OL,17,Fon Friday that Harkin sped away when
OL,18,Fpolice started to follow him, driving
OL,19,Fthrough a red light and causing a
OL,20,Fnumber of vehicles to swerve out of his
OL,21,Fway.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
